{%- comment -%}
  Head assets, rendered once from layout/theme.liquid. Order matters and is
  fixed by docs/THEME_PLAN.md section 2.6:
    1. layer order declaration
    2. tokens.css
    3. (later commits, see the marked block below)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} 1. Declares the cascade layer order once, so file load order never changes specificity. {%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  @layer tokens, reset, base, components, sections, utilities;
</style>

{%- comment -%} 2. Design tokens (already wrapped in @layer tokens). {%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'tokens.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- comment -%}
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------
  LATER COMMITS ADD HERE, IN THIS ORDER (do not reorder):
    B4  snippets/fonts.liquid   {% raw %}{% render 'fonts' %}{% endraw %} (preloads + @font-face, behind fonts_ready)
    B5  assets/base.css         stylesheet_tag, render-blocking on purpose
    B6  assets/base-lines.css   stylesheet_tag
    B6  assets/grid.css         stylesheet_tag
  Section and snippet CSS is loaded by the section or snippet that uses it.
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  TEMPORARY. Visually hidden helpers for the skip link and the live region.
  Moves to assets/base.css (layer utilities / base) in B5; delete this block
  in that commit. Only tokens are used for design values. The 1px / -1px /
  inset(50%) values are the standard visually-hidden technique, not design
  values.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  @layer utilities {
    .visually-hidden,
    .skip-link:not(:focus) {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      margin: -1px;
      padding: 0;
      border: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip-path: inset(50%);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .skip-link {
      position: fixed;
      inset-block-start: var(--space-4);
      inset-inline-start: var(--space-4);
      z-index: 1;
      padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: var(--color-brand);
      color: var(--color-on-brand);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: var(--type-button-size);
      line-height: var(--type-button-line);
      font-weight: var(--type-button-weight);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .skip-link:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }
  }
</style>
